71146596128194_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=2ZElgZwbko0Q7kNvwFujzm3&_nc_oc=AdoN4BbsIRR3Vo620rjCUQDwDrxPFSnC9x-6qfapOMeo9pc8wi7_HhhL5CwGfL4oVNU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLqmUU5jjEfI7eLVka2aX4GX-HuRgXLzujr0YMbVQ0p_g&oe=6AA6A0B9"}, {"file_name": "1.png", "id": "2116332565928774", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499622315_2116332569262107_6472776043868426897_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=4-RdhLpD-NYQ7kNvwHYz3ka&_nc_oc=AdqQtTXDqRAtr5nGHB9xZM7sxmv3Ct0DbFHKeoASDH3U5NVgQayl-0xHMQ6ZoM9Rz-s&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJgtAMw_r4dD8O0OLav881rqPWmsyEFJ71oqZLYnkv3-A&oe=6AA6B393"}, {"file_name": "4.png", "id": "909457358817429", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499623558_909457362150762_5574869297430657880_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=uO8tZp6Kkm0Q7kNvwGrzo1V&_nc_oc=AdpeMIjITrRsqFZ-goKoGsvsJW23or1w8HKXAZGJbzEb0QjelUZlA7VN3HByhpgRCJs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIzlcT7qau8a0tinuBAhw8O012smD9Mxw5NhqMw4JRtGQ&oe=6AA6B1DA"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Wild", "keywords": ["social", "free", "hangout", "friends", "chat"], "long_description": "**Explore with friends.**\n\nWild is one big social space. Walk across the map, follow the noise, visit other players, or let your curiosity lead the way.\n\n**Life as a duck.**\n\nCustomize your duck avatar, and express yourself in ways only possible inside VR. Walk, run, or jump around with hand-based movement.\n\n**Welcome to the community.**\n\nWhen you join Wild, you\u2019re joining a new world that is constantly changing. Tune into events, changes to the map, or try out the latest cosmetics.\n", "short_description": "Wild is a social VR hangout world. Explore a shared city, meet friends, and host events."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https: